{"seq":2,"slug":"vi-vs-mcmc","title":"变分推断与 MCMC：优化派与采样派的分野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/vi-vs-mcmc","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"变分推断与-mcmc-优化派与采样派的分野\">变分推断与 MCMC：优化派与采样派的分野</h1><p>同样是应对算不出的后验，变分推断和马尔可夫链蒙特卡洛（MCMC）代表了两种世界观。MCMC 说：我不去逼近后验的形状，我造一条随机游走，让它在后验的地形上停留，停得越久，我收集的脚印就越忠实地还原地形——只要你给我足够的时间，我给你任意精度。VI 说：等不起那么久，我先猜一个形状简单、处处可算的分布，再拧参数让它尽量贴近后验——精度我认栽一点，但我要快、要能塞进百万数据、要能接进梯度下降。理解这两种世界观的取舍，是选对推断工具的前提。本篇只做定位比较，MCMC 采样器本身的机理（细致平衡、HMC 的哈密顿动力学、NUTS 的自适应）由《贝叶斯数据分析》hub 主讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-确定性优化-vs-随机采样\">核心概念：确定性优化 vs 随机采样</h2><p>两者的根本差异，一句话概括：VI 求的是一个<strong>分布的参数</strong>（确定性优化的解），MCMC 求的是一堆<strong>后验的样本</strong>（随机过程的产物）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;不可解后验 p(z|x)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;VI:优化派&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;MCMC:采样派&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;选分布族 q_φ&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;最大化 ELBO&lt;br/&gt;梯度下降调 φ&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[&quot;输出:一个解析近似 q*&lt;br/&gt;有系统偏差·可复用&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;构造马尔可夫链&lt;br/&gt;平稳分布=后验&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;跑链·丢弃 burn-in&lt;br/&gt;收集样本&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[&quot;输出:后验样本集&lt;br/&gt;渐近无偏·蒙特卡洛误差&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"不可解后验 p(z|x)\"] --&gt; B[\"VI:优化派\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"MCMC:采样派\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"选分布族 q_φ\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[\"最大化 ELBO&lt;br/&gt;梯度下降调 φ\"]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[\"输出:一个解析近似 q*&lt;br/&gt;有系统偏差·可复用\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"构造马尔可夫链&lt;br/&gt;平稳分布=后验\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[\"跑链·丢弃 burn-in&lt;br/&gt;收集样本\"]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[\"输出:后验样本集&lt;br/&gt;渐近无偏·蒙特卡洛误差\"]</pre><p>VI 的解是一个可以反复调用的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随时能算密度、能采样、能求期望；MCMC 的产物是一批样本，任何后验期望都靠样本平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>S</mi></mfrac><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}_p[f]\\approx\\frac1S\\sum_s f(z^{(s)})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.233em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 估计，想要新的期望就得回头翻样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏差与方差-两种误差的来源不同\">偏差与方差：两种误差的来源不同</h2><p>这是两派最本质的分歧。MCMC 的误差是<strong>方差型</strong>的：链跑够长、样本够多，估计会渐近收敛到真值，误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>S</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\sqrt{S})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随有效样本量缩小，理论上无系统偏差。VI 的误差是<strong>偏差型</strong>的：即便优化到全局最优、ELBO 抬到族内极限，只要真后验不在你选的分布族 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7805em;vertical-align:-0.0972em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^\\star</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与真后验之间就永远隔着一道无法靠更多计算消除的鸿沟。</p>\n<p>这条差异有直接的实用含义。VI 典型地<strong>低估后验方差</strong>、给出过窄的可信区间——它的反向 KL 目标和平均场假设都在推着近似去抓单个主峰、忽略尾部与相关性（机理见 <a href=\"../elbo/kl-divergence\">KL 散度与方向</a> 和 <a href=\"../algorithms/mean-field\">平均场近似</a>）。如果你的下游决策对不确定性的校准很敏感（风险定价、医疗、主动学习的采集函数），这种过度自信可能是致命的，此时 MCMC 的无偏性值得那份等待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛判定-一个能看-一个难看\">收敛判定：一个能看，一个难看</h2><p>工程上一个常被忽略却极重要的差别，是「怎么知道它跑好了」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>变分推断 (VI)</th>\n<th>MCMC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>误差类型</td>\n<td>系统偏差（族限制）</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛信号</td>\n<td>ELBO 曲线趋平（明确）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、有效样本量、轨迹图（需经验判断）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>快，常快 1-2 个数量级</td>\n<td>慢，尤其高维强相关后验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据可扩展</td>\n<td>强，天然支持小批量随机梯度</td>\n<td>弱，多数采样器需扫全量数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行/GPU</td>\n<td>友好，就是张量优化</td>\n<td>较难，链内串行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性质量</td>\n<td>常低估方差、过度自信</td>\n<td>校准良好（渐近正确）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多峰后验</td>\n<td>易困在单峰</td>\n<td>混合好时可跨峰（实践中也难）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端可微</td>\n<td>支持（VAE 等靠它）</td>\n<td>一般不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VI 的收敛几乎「肉眼可判」——盯着 ELBO 曲线，趋平即停。MCMC 的收敛诊断是门手艺：要看多条链的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（Gelman-Rubin 统计量）是否接近 1、有效样本量是否够、轨迹图有没有卡住。这个判定成本，是 MCMC 隐性门槛的一大来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时选谁-一张决策心法\">何时选谁：一张决策心法</h2><p>不必把两者当敌人。现代概率编程框架（Pyro、NumPyro、Stan）往往同时提供 SVI 与 NUTS，让你按场景切换，甚至互相验证。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选 VI</strong>：数据量巨大（百万级以上）、需要实时/在线推断、模型是深度可微网络（VAE、贝叶斯神经网络）、只需要后验的点估计或粗略不确定性、要把推断嵌进更大的训练循环。</li>\n<li><strong>选 MCMC</strong>：数据量中小、模型维度不太高、需要可信校准的不确定性、后验可能多峰或强相关、结论要发表或用于高风险决策。</li>\n<li><strong>两者并用</strong>：先用 VI 快速探路、给 MCMC 提供好的初始化；或用少量 MCMC 样本给 VI 的近似质量做「对拍」诊断（PSIS-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是常用的定量指标，详见 <a href=\"../practice/vi-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个务实的经验法则：先用 VI 拿到能跑通的结果和量级感，等要为最终不确定性负责时，再用 MCMC 在关键子问题上核验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VI 与 MCMC 是应对不可解后验的两条路：VI 求分布参数（优化），MCMC 求后验样本（采样）。</li>\n<li>误差性质不同：MCMC 是可随计算消减的方差型误差、渐近无偏；VI 是无法消除的偏差型误差、常低估方差。</li>\n<li>VI 快、可扩展、GPU 友好、可微、收敛易判；MCMC 精度高、不确定性校准好，但慢、难扩展、收敛诊断靠经验。</li>\n<li>选型看场景：海量数据/实时/可微选 VI，中小数据/高风险/要校准选 MCMC，二者常互为初始化与对拍。</li>\n<li>MCMC 采样器的内部机理不在本 hub，见《贝叶斯数据分析》；本篇只负责把 VI 放到对照系里定位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇的动机铺垫：<a href=\"why-vi\">为何变分推断</a></li>\n<li>VI 的正式数学骨架：<a href=\"vi-model\">变分框架</a></li>\n<li>VI 低估方差的机理根源：<a href=\"../elbo/kl-divergence\">KL 散度与方向</a></li>\n<li>跨库·MCMC 的完整机理（细致平衡、HMC/NUTS）：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/computation/mcmc\">贝叶斯数据分析 · MCMC</a></li>\n<li>跨库·VI 在贝叶斯计算工具链里的定位：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/computation/variational-inference\">贝叶斯数据分析 · 变分推断</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变分推断与 MCMC：优化派与采样派的分野","id":"变分推断与-mcmc-优化派与采样派的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：确定性优化 vs 随机采样","id":"核心概念-确定性优化-vs-随机采样"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差与方差：两种误差的来源不同","id":"偏差与方差-两种误差的来源不同"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛判定：一个能看，一个难看","id":"收敛判定-一个能看-一个难看"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选谁：一张决策心法","id":"何时选谁-一张决策心法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何变分推断：当后验算不出来的时候","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/why-vi"},"next":{"title":"变分框架：隐变量、变分族与优化配方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/vi-model"}}